# Pairs with PendingOnlyForCompleteSplit. The durable pending record rolls its phase back.
MODULE: RecordPendingBeforeSplitComplete
TARGET: PendingOnlyForCompleteSplit
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a pending parent link describes an incomplete split
PERTURBS: RecordPending

--- FIND
RecordPending ==
    /\ phase = "ready"
    /\ held \/ marker
    /\ ~pending
    /\ pending' = TRUE
    /\ phase' = "ready"
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: retain a pending record while the split is idle.
RecordPending ==
    /\ phase = "ready"
    /\ held \/ marker
    /\ ~pending
    /\ pending' = TRUE
    /\ phase' = "idle"
--- END
